When calculate with a standard calculator, have you ever forget the previous step? Have you ever remember whether you miss a step? Yes, we need an calculator with every step, just like printing calculator.

    Although this calculator only has basic arithmetic operations, but it can meet most of our needs, such as checking accounts, calculating a shopping list, digital subtraction accumulate.

    The biggest advantage of this calculator is the ability to record every step of the operation, and you can choose any step then modify it, recalculate, without re-enter it.

Features and Benefits:
- Simple, rapid, accurate;
- View every step of the operations, make sure it's right;
- Free to modify each step, recalculate the results;
- Add comments;
- View recent history, and edit any history;
- Mailing your calculation;
- Print your calculations list;
- According to personal habits set a different layout or color;

Calculators:
- Formula Calculator
- List Calculator
- Unit Converter Calculator
- Loan Calculator
- Tip Calculator
- Math Calculators
- Numeral System Calculators
- Custom Calculators

A tool for opening and viewing PSD document files on iPhone, iPod or iPad. When you install PSD.See on your iOS device you will be able to open PSD files from Mail, Safari or any other application that supports opening files in external utilities like Dropbox, Google Drive, SkyDrive or ownCloud.

1. open psd file (even big files) very fast;
2. support to preview PSD actions on mobile;
3. support to create new psd file from device's image in photos to PSD;
4. iTunes File Sharing support, so you can easily upload big files using your USB cable directly to your device using your computer and iTunes;
5. support to open png, jpeg and more other format image files;
6. support to transfer files face-to-face.
